; Pin the public npm registry for this repo.
;
; The Chainguard Libraries for JavaScript registry (libraries.cgr.dev) is
; configured machine-wide in many contributors' ~/.npmrc and requires a
; short-lived auth token (chainctl auth token). Without this file, a local
; `npm install` would silently rewrite package-lock.json's resolved URLs to
; that registry — and CI, which has no credentials for it, would then fail
; on `npm ci`. This repo-level setting always wins over the user config, so
; installs here always resolve against the public registry that CI can reach.
;
; This file is tracked in git. Never add _authToken (or any credential) to it —
; per-user tokens belong in ~/.npmrc only.
registry=https://registry.npmjs.org/
